<description>&lt;p&gt;Violent gangs are seizing thousands of homes in Mexico City while the arrest of a Gulf Cartel leader has ignited riots in northern Mexico, and a mayor who opposed cartels was assassinated, prompting his son’s detention and a brief halt of trucker protests that later resumed after talks with authorities. Federal agents have charged a Mexican engineer with building a 1,900‑foot cross-border drug tunnel and brought terrorism charges against him, and a cross-border drug operation was uncovered in San Diego County. A 7‑year-old American girl was among six dead in cartel violence in Matamoros. 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxQWS1CNmxOSjRTN19MSjRSNUFBUWdtV2hLUlJBd21jd0RwMG5mTjZyc3JDT3dmUG5PNWVVTUhYbWotQVFEWTFjd3hvS3haOTdObjctT1ZaSXRVMmttejY0SE5PTFFKaDBIcG9VbWRYR2c4SnZkNlVZUGZtNmxHcDAtSTc3a0E5MWdWWDBYdklEZ1RqMjRnbXZoempKLTBCYUlHRUFWZWdKRTFxV1BPejFmSlZLdW83RUU?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi-_?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hindustan Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxNckRwQkwtR3JidHFxVEJIeVUzNUMxeGh1cksxUUJsNDlRNVp3STJ0YVJ3ZHR0eTJmeTF3amYxbUVNazhKS3hZcmh2SmFobGFyV0NUcUNPT3hGNVZyWTFaRFpPSFNCdlhpbTlQV0o5VVJjckUxVXBWNDZZR2tHQXVkMmh2WVFVaENhaXZ2eFMtMXF3SXhlR1ZGQ29WZU1BckEyTXZiTWpSUjh3ejZLNlpBbURkaVU?oc=5&quot;&gt;KABB&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Imperial Valley Press Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC7 Chicago&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMibkFVX3lxTE90VUxLVV9SdDZNcml4R1hVTEk0clRTMmgtWFIweVFfZXNBWkNrSnAwSUZhSnZnX1g0NWZkdXBYTDJseXNfQnZPeFZIQV9EdnpkR3FRR2FBVlNjcUV0dFJwVmNjZUZHMFJEOThwd0Nn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Mexico Solidarity Media&l